<title>AUSTRALIA: SFE markets to trade through SYCOM on Monday.</title>
<headline>SFE markets to trade through SYCOM on Monday.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The trading floor of the Sydney Futures Exchange  (SFE) will be closed on Monday, August 4, due to the bank holiday  in the New South Wales state.</p>
<p>An official for the SFE said all futures instruments would be available  for trading through the screen-based SYCOM system at the usual floor  trading times.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
